                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.6124/28: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Helsingfors</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Haynes</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Helsingfors</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-20T11:00:00+01:39"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1920—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 20—9:18
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>527. Deported crossed and welcomed into Russia January 19th, 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Haynes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
